 147:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****       The linked-list management is a software processing independently of DMA channel hardware. It
 148:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****       build, create, insert, remove, replace, circularize, convert both nodes and queue in order to
