 459:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****       When application needs that DMA transfers are conditioned by internal or external events, the
 460:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****       do that. Trigger signals are a set of device signal that are linked to DMA trigger inputs tha
 461:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****       DMA transfers.
 462:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****       To setup a trigger transfers, three DMA channel parameters are needed:
 463:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c **** 
 464:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****           (+) Trigger mode
 465:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****               This parameter specifies the trig level.
 466:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****                (++) Block level
 467:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****                (++) Repeated block level
 468:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****                (++) Node level
 469:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****                (++) Single / Burst level
 470:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c **** 
 471:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****           (+) Trigger polarity
 472:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****               This parameter specifies the DMA trigger sensitivity (Rising or falling).
 473:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c **** 
 474:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****           (+) Trigger selection
