 805:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****           mode).
 806:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****       (+) The HAL_DMAEx_List_Start_IT() function allows to start the DMA channel transfer in linked
 807:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****           (Non-blocking mode).
 808:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****               (++) It is mandatory to register a linked-list queue to be executed by a DMA channel 
 809:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****                    transfer otherwise a HAL_ERROR will be returned.
